flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/an-overlay-lower-inside-a-protected-path.zon: flong.box drives containers.box, and would bind /srv/gate/data into a session. That reaches flong's state, the user manager's bus or private socket, /proc, the cgroup filesystem or a path in flong.box.protect, any of which lets a session act as the caller outside it. The check here is lexical; the launcher's canonical one refuses the rest at launch.
